&lt;p&gt;👉 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@baaqar/artifact-to-pwa" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;Install from NPM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

